      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working at a repair shop here in Seoul and I just opened a high-end smartphone and the battery is visibly swollen. It's pushing against the screen. What are the immediate safety steps I need to take and how do I dispose of it properly? I need to know the standard SOP for this.",
